    },
    "body": "PR #1355 delivered the principal evidence correction and focused served-validator fix. This follow-up records the actual cumulative charge after that protected delivery, bringing the live ledger to 380,915,640 / 390,700,000 ms. The receipt separates an estimated pre-projection audit interval, a timed post-projection interval, and a delivery allowance; it also discloses the temporary-build storage projection miss and both build-cache cleanups. Current state now matches the live local ledger.\n\nValidation: JSON parse, claim-wording gate, and git diff --check pass. No new model fit or paid compute. References #820 and #973.\n",
